# REFERENCE for /d2-activity — order payment process (payment). Not a real doc.
# Points to mimic:
#   - Leading comment; the .d2 source stands alone (no frontmatter, not embedded in flows.md).
#   - direction + shape/color by node TYPE (circle=start/end, diamond=decision, default ▭=step).
#   - Edges have a branch label AFTER the ":"; loop A -> B -> A is valid.
#   - QUOTE labels containing structural characters ( ) / | : (D2 reads them as syntax) — e.g. "Send request to gateway (Momo / VNPay)".

direction: down

start: Customer clicks Pay { shape: circle; style.fill: "#E8F0FE" }

checkCart: Cart still valid? { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF4E5" }
chooseMethod: Customer chooses payment method
createTxn: Create pending transaction
callGateway: "Send request to gateway (Momo / VNPay)"
paid: Gateway reports payment success? { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF4E5" }
retry: Tried fewer than 3 times? { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF4E5" }
confirm: "Update order: paid"
notify: Send invoice email to customer
cancel: Cancel transaction and release held stock
expire: Notify cart expired, return to cart

endOk: Payment complete { shape: circle; style.fill: "#E6F4EA" }
endFail: Payment failed { shape: circle; style.fill: "#E6F4EA" }

start -> checkCart
checkCart -> expire: No
checkCart -> chooseMethod: Yes
chooseMethod -> createTxn
createTxn -> callGateway
callGateway -> paid
paid -> confirm: Success
confirm -> notify
notify -> endOk
paid -> retry: Failure
retry -> chooseMethod: Attempts left
retry -> cancel: No attempts left
cancel -> endFail
expire -> endFail
